{#- robots.txt — written, rather than left to a 404.

   A missing robots.txt is not neutral: every crawler asks for it first, and a
   404 is answered by guessing. This says the two things worth saying — come
   in, and here is the map.

   THE CONSOLE IS NAMED EVEN THOUGH CLOUDFLARE ACCESS ALREADY REFUSES IT.
   Access returns a login page, which is a 200 with words in it, and a crawler
   that follows /staff/ gets that instead of the site. Disallow keeps it out of
   the index. It is tidiness, not a control — the real door is Access, and
   nothing here should ever be mistaken for one. -#}
User-agent: *
Allow: /
Disallow: /admin/
Disallow: /staff/

